    "text": "The explosive in a Hydrogen bomb is a mixture of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><none></none><mn>2</mn><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>1</mn><none></none></mmultiscripts><mo>,</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><none></none><mn>3</mn><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>1</mn><none></none></mmultiscripts></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>Li</mi><none></none><mn>6</mn><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>3</mn><none></none></mmultiscripts></math> in some condensed form. The chain reaction is given by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>Li</mi><none></none><mn>6</mn><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>3</mn><none></none></mmultiscripts><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><none></none><mn>1</mn><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>0</mn><none></none></mmultiscripts><mo>→</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>He</mi><none></none><mn>4</mn><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>2</mn><none></none></mmultiscripts><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><none></none><mn>3</mn><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>1</mn><none></none></mmultiscripts></math>;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><none></none><mn>2</mn><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>1</mn><none></none></mmultiscripts><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><none></none><mn>3</mn><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>1</mn><none></none></mmultiscripts><mo>→</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>He</mi><none></none><mn>4</mn><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>2</mn><none></none></mmultiscripts><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><none></none><mn>1</mn><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>0</mn><none></none></mmultiscripts></math></p><p>During the explosion the energy released is approximately [Given : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>Li</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01690</mn><mo> </mo><mi>amu</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">,</mo><mo mathvariant=\"italic\"> </mo><mi>M</mi><mfenced><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><none></none><mn>2</mn><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>1</mn><none></none></mmultiscripts></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01471</mn><mo> </mo><mi>amu</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>M</mi><mfenced><mmultiscripts><mi>He</mi><none></none><mn>4</mn><mprescripts></mprescripts><mn>2</mn><none></none></mmultiscripts></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>00388</mn><mo> </mo><mi>amu</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo> </mo><mi>amu</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>931</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo> </mo><mi>MeV</mi></math>]",
